        {
            "en": "He thought she was crying about last night.",
            "vi": "Anh nghĩ rằng cô ấy đã khóc về đêm qua."
        },
        {
            "en": "Drunk and crying, she didn't bother opening her eyes.",
            "vi": "Say rượu và khóc lóc, cô không thèm mở mắt."
        },
        {
            "en": "She sat in her room crying like a child, blowing her nose and sobbing.",
